DOS-PORT (patch 0104, Phase 10 Stage 5). Auto-detect runtime selection
chain WB → OPL3 → Organya for SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_AUDIO_BACKEND=auto and
the new default (env unset). Per user's locked Tier-1 decision
2026-05-06: AUDIO_BACKEND default flipped from organya (slot 0100) to
auto (this slot) — operator no longer needs to set the env var to
engage Phase 10 audio offload; engine picks the best available music
backend at startup automatically.

CLOSES Phase 10 audio offload (Stages 1-5):
  Stage 1   (slot —, scripts/fetch-cs-midi.py): 41/41 .mid coverage
  Stage 2   (slot 0101): MidiScheduler + MidiBackendStub
  Stage 3   (slot 0102): MidiBackendWaveBlaster
  Stage 4   (slot 0103): MidiBackendOpl3 (8-patch placeholder bank)
  Stage 5   (slot 0104, this): auto-detect chain + default flip
  Phase 10.5 follow-ups deferred (idle-pause flip-on, fuller GM bank,
  velocity/CC dispatch refinements) — await flush-instr W22-WB-B
  real-HW findings to inform prioritization.

MODIFIED (4):

  src/Utils/diagnostic_timers.h — extend AudioBackend enum with
    auto_select = 6 (transient state for "chain not yet resolved";
    SoundManager::init resolves to organya/wb/opl3 before any
    counters fire).

  src/graphics/Renderer.cpp — backend_to_string handles auto_select
    case (renders as "auto"; transient; should never appear in
    [audio-block] emit since init resolves before counters fire).

  src/sound/AudioBackend.cpp — selectBackendFromEnv: env "auto" /
    unset / empty all map to AudioBackend::auto_select (was organya
    at slot 0100). Explicit overrides (organya / wb / opl3 / midi-
    stub / tracker) skip the chain and instantiate directly per
    existing slot-0102/0103 logic.

  src/sound/SoundManager.cpp — refactored backend-install dispatch:
    1. File-scope helper functions: _try_install_wb_backend(),
       _try_install_opl3_backend(), _install_midi_stub_backend(),
       _narrate_organya_fallback(const char *which). Each helper
       handles probe + install + sticky-enum-mutation + log
       narration; auto-detect chain calls them in sequence without
       code duplication.
    2. SoundManager::init backend dispatch: replaced 3-block
       if/else if chain with switch on g_p10_audio_backend_active.
       New auto_select case runs the chain:
         LOG_INFO("auto-detect: probing wb...")
         _try_install_wb_backend() ? "wb selected" : continue
         LOG_INFO("auto-detect: wb probe failed, trying opl3...")
         _try_install_opl3_backend() ? "opl3 selected" : continue
         LOG_INFO("auto-detect: opl3 probe failed, falling back to organya")
         _narrate_organya_fallback("auto-detect chain (WB + OPL3 both)")
    3. organya / tracker / none cases: no MidiScheduler involvement;
       fall through to existing Organya / OGG dispatch in music() /
       runFade(). No-op.

Smoke (DOSBox-X-fast, 6 gates per team-lead 2026-05-06 dispatch):

  Gate 1 — AUDIO_BACKEND=auto explicit: chain probes wb → DOSBox-X
    MPU-401 emulation responds → "wb backend ready (MPU-401 at
    0x0330, UART mode active)" → MidiBackendWaveBlaster armed →
    "auto-detect: wb selected." 39 flips, no crashes.

  Gate 2 — AUDIO_BACKEND unset (DEFAULT-FLIP): IDENTICAL behavior
    to Gate 1; selectBackendFromEnv treats null/empty value the
    same as "auto". Confirms the default-flip is in effect — no
    operator action required to engage Phase 10 audio offload.
    39 flips, no crashes.

  Gate 3 — AUDIO_BACKEND=organya forced: "audio backend: organya
    (forced; Phase 10 baseline)" — explicit override skips the
    chain. 38 flips, no crashes. Regression unchanged.

  Gate 4 — AUDIO_BACKEND=wb forced: direct wb install; "wb backend
    ready" + "MidiScheduler armed with MidiBackendWaveBlaster".
    37 flips, no crashes. Regression unchanged.

  Gate 5 — AUDIO_BACKEND=opl3 forced: direct opl3 attempt; probe
    fails under DOSBox-X (Adlib timer-1 sequence); roll back to
    organya gracefully. 37 flips, no crashes. Regression unchanged.

  Gate 6 — AUDIO_BACKEND=midi-stub forced: "MidiScheduler armed
    with MidiBackendStub". 37 flips, no crashes. Regression
    unchanged.

Quality gates per team-lead's dispatch:
  1. ✓ AUDIO_BACKEND=auto chain probes WB → succeeds → narration
     confirms (Gate 1)
  2. ✓ Real-HW alternative path verified by code-inspection: when
     WB probe fails OR is unavailable (e.g., g2k without S2),
     chain attempts OPL3; on g2k BLASTER T6 = SB16 = OPL3 present,
     OPL3 probe succeeds. Narration: "auto-detect: wb probe
     failed, trying opl3..." → "opl3 backend ready..." →
     "auto-detect: opl3 selected." (string-grep verified in
     binary; not exercised under DOSBox-X 2025.02 because WB
     probe always succeeds first)
  3. ✓ No env var set: same behavior as auto (Gate 2; default-flip
     confirmed)
  4. ✓ Explicit organya/wb/opl3/midi-stub regressions unchanged
     (Gates 3, 4, 5, 6)
  5. ✓ Patch applies cleanly on top of nxengine-evo/0103
  6. ✓ strings-grep verifies auto-detect chain narration:
     "auto-detect: probing wb..." / "auto-detect: wb selected." /
     "auto-detect: wb probe failed, trying opl3..." /
     "auto-detect: opl3 selected." / "auto-detect: opl3 probe
     failed, falling back to organya." / "auto-detect chain (WB +
     OPL3 both)"

